<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Cloud Home Lab - Status</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding-top: 80px; background: #f4f4f4; }
        .card { background: white; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        h1 { color: #333; }
        p { color: #666; font-size: 18px; }
        .status-item { font-weight: bold; color: #0066cc; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Cloud Home Lab</h1>
        <p>Fabio De Bartolomeo - Infrastructure & Cloud Engineer</p>
        <hr>
        <p>Stato Host Ospitante (nota: all'avvio dei servizi):</p>
        <p>IP Privato: <span class="status-item">{{IP_PRIVATO}}</span></p>
        <p>Uptime: <span class="status-item">{{UPTIME}}</span></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>